1
00:00:19,039 --> 00:00:20,160
What year was she born?

2
00:00:21,760 --> 00:00:22,679
How should I know?

3
00:00:23,399 --> 00:00:24,120
You don't know?

4
00:00:25,199 --> 00:00:28,120
Then how can you prove she's your boss's runaway concubine,

5
00:00:28,399 --> 00:00:29,960
and not that you're out here in broad daylight

6
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:31,640
kidnapping a decent woman?

7
00:00:32,880 --> 00:00:34,359
Kidnapping an innocent girl?

8
00:00:34,759 --> 00:00:35,719
I misspoke earlier!

9
00:00:36,439 --> 00:00:38,719
She's just a filthy whore from Minchun Pavilion!

10
00:00:39,159 --> 00:00:41,439
I'm taking her back to Minchun Pavilion right now!

11
00:00:45,039 --> 00:00:47,759
Everyone, don't listen to his nonsense!

12
00:00:49,119 --> 00:00:50,240
She has a Good Citizen Pass!

13
00:00:57,399 --> 00:00:58,439
What are you standing around for?

14
00:01:00,280 --> 00:01:01,119
Get the hell out of here!

15
00:01:11,480 --> 00:01:12,400
You just wait!

16
00:01:14,760 --> 00:01:16,200
You, you, go guard the boat!

17
00:01:16,200 --> 00:01:17,640
Yes, sir! The rest of you, lock down the pier!

18
00:01:17,640 --> 00:01:18,560
Nobody leaves!

19
00:01:19,439 --> 00:01:21,799
Move along! Break it up! Clear out!

20
00:01:23,959 --> 00:01:25,120
Make a more convincing one next time.

21
00:01:29,760 --> 00:01:30,560
Thank you.

22
00:01:31,000 --> 00:01:32,480
With wolves ahead and tigers behind,

23
00:01:33,159 --> 00:01:34,040
as of now,

24
00:01:34,280 --> 00:01:35,159
you have nowhere to go.

25
00:01:35,519 --> 00:01:36,319
How about this?

26
00:01:36,760 --> 00:01:37,640
Come to the Sanshan Gang.

27
00:01:38,680 --> 00:01:40,560
I'll get a doctor to treat your wounds.

28
00:01:40,959 --> 00:01:41,959
Lay low for a few days.

29
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:44,439
You can leave once the heat dies down.

30
00:01:45,719 --> 00:01:46,239
You...

31
00:01:47,599 --> 00:01:48,959
Why are you helping me?

32
00:01:50,920 --> 00:01:52,159
That commemorative badge you're wearing...

33
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:54,359
I have one too.

34
00:01:56,560 --> 00:01:58,280
Dali, take her back.

35
00:01:59,239 --> 00:01:59,920
Come with me.

36
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:14,919
Who's there at this hour?

37
00:02:20,439 --> 00:02:21,439
What do you want?

38
00:02:21,439 --> 00:02:23,199
I... I'm looking for Chen Dieyi.

39
00:02:23,719 --> 00:02:24,680
What do you want with her?

40
00:02:24,919 --> 00:02:26,000
I need her help.

41
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:28,120
Where are you from?

42
00:02:28,840 --> 00:02:30,879
Min... Minchun Pavilion.

43
00:02:32,599 --> 00:02:33,719
Get lost. She isn't here.

44
00:02:34,439 --> 00:02:35,280
Please!

45
00:02:35,439 --> 00:02:36,639
Just let me see her.

46
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,199
Just for a minute!

47
00:02:38,520 --> 00:02:39,639
What's going on out there?

48
00:02:39,639 --> 00:02:41,120
Nothing. Just a beggar.

49
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:42,840
Chen Dieyi! Chen Dieyi!

50
00:02:42,919 --> 00:02:44,000
Please help me!

51
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:45,879
Open the door.

52
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:48,080
Sister Dieyi, she's from Minchun Pavilion.

53
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,680
The police were just here to investigate today.

54
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:50,759
She's big trouble.

55
00:02:51,240 --> 00:02:52,039
Open the door.

56
00:02:54,159 --> 00:02:55,680
Chen Dieyi! Chen Dieyi!

57
00:03:02,039 --> 00:03:03,719
Please, save me!

58
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,520
Scissors, keys, knockout drug.

59
00:03:31,639 --> 00:03:32,719
Everything you asked for is right here.

60
00:03:32,719 --> 00:03:34,240
Whatever you do, don't say I gave them to you.

61
00:03:38,240 --> 00:03:39,840
Here's the agreed payment.

62
00:04:01,599 --> 00:04:02,879
Sister Yumei is dead.

63
00:04:03,319 --> 00:04:04,520
Sister Furong is dead, too.

64
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:06,080
We really had no other choice

65
00:04:06,080 --> 00:04:07,039
but to come to you.

66
00:04:07,199 --> 00:04:08,800
Sister Yumei said you could help us.

67
00:04:10,599 --> 00:04:13,280
Please, I beg you! Please!

68
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:14,800
Please help us!

69
00:04:15,759 --> 00:04:16,519
I beg you!

70
00:04:17,399 --> 00:04:19,319
Sister Dieyi, she's nothing but trouble.

71
00:04:19,639 --> 00:04:21,680
She could drag the dance hall down with her.

72
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:23,920
We worked so hard to get where we are.

73
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:25,360
There's no need to risk it for her—

74
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:27,079
No, please! Don't!

75
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:30,120
Did that bitch run that way?

76
00:04:30,920 --> 00:04:31,600
Search thoroughly!

77
00:04:31,800 --> 00:04:33,040
Catch her and skin her alive!

78
00:04:33,040 --> 00:04:33,879
Check everywhere!

79
00:04:34,079 --> 00:04:34,920
Please...

80
00:04:38,079 --> 00:04:38,759
Hide in here.

81
00:04:50,319 --> 00:04:51,120
Boss Chen.

82
00:04:51,600 --> 00:04:53,040
Why is it so noisy out there?

83
00:04:53,319 --> 00:04:54,399
It's so late.

84
00:04:54,680 --> 00:04:55,439
What's going on?

85
00:04:56,399 --> 00:04:57,639
We're looking for a girl.

86
00:04:57,720 --> 00:04:58,680
She ran this way.

87
00:04:58,680 --> 00:04:59,480
Did you see her?

88
00:05:00,360 --> 00:05:01,759
A girl?

89
00:05:03,040 --> 00:05:04,199
She was running fast.

90
00:05:04,199 --> 00:05:05,439
Looked like she went that way.

91
00:05:05,519 --> 00:05:06,639
Thank you, Boss Chen. Thank you!

92
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:07,199
Let's go.

93
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:15,600
She escaped into Club Jasmine.

94
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:20,879
Club Jasmine caters to high officials and elites.

95
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:22,800
We didn't dare barge in to seize her.

96
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:24,120
Besides, Boss Chen, Hall Master Lian,

97
00:05:24,120 --> 00:05:25,560
and Deputy Chief Li are childhood friends.

98
00:05:26,040 --> 00:05:27,439
We can't afford to cross them.

99
00:05:29,639 --> 00:05:33,519
Chen Dieyi is a pragmatic woman.

100
00:05:34,720 --> 00:05:36,240
She won't ask for trouble.

101
00:05:37,439 --> 00:05:40,560
Keep a tight watch on Club Jasmine.

102
00:05:41,319 --> 00:05:42,439
Don't take your eyes off it!

103
00:05:42,600 --> 00:05:43,399
Yes, sir. Right away.

104
00:05:50,720 --> 00:05:51,639
What on earth happened?

105
00:05:53,319 --> 00:05:53,959
Boss Chen...

106
00:05:54,439 --> 00:05:55,120
Get up first.

107
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:58,839
Tell me what happened.

108
00:06:00,040 --> 00:06:01,199
Here's what happened.

109
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:03,240
Over a month ago...

110
00:06:23,040 --> 00:06:24,839
Besides, the four of us have no one else to turn to.

111
00:06:24,839 --> 00:06:26,439
If we didn't come to you, we'd be as good as dead.

112
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:29,519
This is way too big.

113
00:06:30,079 --> 00:06:31,439
Club Jasmine can't protect you.

114
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:33,120
You have to get out of here.

115
00:06:45,680 --> 00:06:46,920
The Chairman was right after all.

116
00:06:47,120 --> 00:06:48,240
Boss Chen is a smart one.

117
00:06:48,439 --> 00:06:50,360
She wouldn't muddy the waters for some cheap whore.

118
00:06:50,720 --> 00:06:51,240
After her!

119
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:52,160
Get her!

120
00:06:53,360 --> 00:06:54,360
Stop, you bitch!

121
00:06:54,399 --> 00:06:55,199
Stop right there!

122
00:07:05,519 --> 00:07:06,240
Hurry!

123
00:07:16,800 --> 00:07:17,279
Go!

124
00:07:19,839 --> 00:07:20,519
Stop right there!

125
00:07:23,199 --> 00:07:24,000
I just stepped outside,

126
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:25,040
why are you chasing me

127
00:07:25,480 --> 00:07:26,639
like you've seen a ghost?

128
00:07:26,879 --> 00:07:27,680
We've been tricked!

129
00:07:28,279 --> 00:07:29,199
It's a diversion!

130
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:30,399
Go, go!

131
00:07:44,040 --> 00:07:45,000
What are you doing here?

132
00:07:46,800 --> 00:07:47,920
Dieyi asked me to come.

133
00:07:50,079 --> 00:07:51,959
I thought I was the only one.

134
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:55,759
I finally managed to get rid of Wang Dali,

135
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:59,199
so why are you here playing third wheel?

136
00:08:09,720 --> 00:08:12,600
And there's fresh Thousand-Layer Steamed Cake.

137
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:14,680
Here.

138
00:08:15,439 --> 00:08:18,040
Haven't had this in ages. Have a seat.

139
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:23,720
Why didn't we meet at Club Jasmine?

140
00:08:25,240 --> 00:08:26,480
My place is being watched.

141
00:08:27,120 --> 00:08:28,319
It's not safe to meet you there.

142
00:08:29,720 --> 00:08:30,439
Why?

143
00:08:31,360 --> 00:08:32,799
The Rongcheng Coastal Defense Map was stolen.

144
00:08:36,679 --> 00:08:37,720
As for the details,

145
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:40,120
I'll let the person involved explain everything.

146
00:08:41,360 --> 00:08:42,120
Come on out.

147
00:08:52,720 --> 00:08:55,120
Don't be afraid. They're all my friends.

148
00:08:55,840 --> 00:08:57,120
Just tell us what you know.

149
00:08:59,879 --> 00:09:00,960
That night...

150
00:09:02,039 --> 00:09:03,799
Sun Hanji had us entertain VIP guests,

151
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:05,600
drug their drinks,

152
00:09:06,919 --> 00:09:08,399
and steal the Rongcheng Coastal Defense Map.

153
00:09:15,240 --> 00:09:16,240
Honored guests,

154
00:09:16,679 --> 00:09:18,879
enjoy the music and drink your fill!

155
00:09:19,559 --> 00:09:20,200
Great!

156
00:09:20,200 --> 00:09:21,639
Take good care of them! Take good care!

157
00:09:33,200 --> 00:09:34,320
All right.

158
00:09:50,759 --> 00:09:52,240
Wake up. Wake up.

159
00:09:52,600 --> 00:09:53,240
Sir.

160
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,679
At first, we didn't know what it was.

161
00:10:02,879 --> 00:10:05,639
When we opened it, it was the Rongcheng Coastal Defense Map.

162
00:10:09,360 --> 00:10:10,519
Sister Yumei said

163
00:10:11,759 --> 00:10:13,840
that if we gave the defense map to Sun Hanji,

164
00:10:14,519 --> 00:10:15,960
he would surely sell it to the Japanese.

165
00:10:16,759 --> 00:10:18,120
Then Rongcheng would be doomed,

166
00:10:18,519 --> 00:10:20,000
and we'd be condemned forever.

167
00:10:23,799 --> 00:10:24,840
To avoid getting caught,

168
00:10:25,159 --> 00:10:26,919
Sister Furong, who had studied painting,

169
00:10:26,919 --> 00:10:28,720
made an exact copy of it.

170
00:10:29,159 --> 00:10:31,759
Then she put the original back into the guest's briefcase,

171
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:33,840
completely undetected.

172
00:10:34,759 --> 00:10:36,039
We may be courtesans,

173
00:10:37,240 --> 00:10:38,720
but Chinese blood runs in our veins.

174
00:10:39,679 --> 00:10:41,600
We could never do anything to harm our own people.

175
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:45,440
But if we didn't hand over the defense map,

176
00:10:46,039 --> 00:10:47,840
Sun Hanji would never let us live.

177
00:10:50,080 --> 00:10:51,480
Sister Yumei came up with a plan.

178
00:10:52,039 --> 00:10:53,639
She divided the map into six pieces.

179
00:10:54,320 --> 00:10:55,639
One piece for each of us.

180
00:10:56,600 --> 00:10:58,399
While the guards at Minchun Pavilion weren't looking,

181
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,639
we escaped from Minchun Pavilion.

182
00:11:00,720 --> 00:11:01,840
If we got caught,

183
00:11:02,320 --> 00:11:03,440
we'd at least have a lifeline.

184
00:11:04,600 --> 00:11:06,679
Sister Yumei had a patch of skin flayed off her,

185
00:11:07,759 --> 00:11:10,120
because she had carved the map onto her back.

186
00:11:11,399 --> 00:11:12,000
Sister Furong,

187
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:13,600
unable to bear the brutal torture,

188
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:15,200
handed over her piece and was killed anyway.

189
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:17,559
Now Qiushuang and Haitang

190
00:11:17,559 --> 00:11:18,799
have been taken to Sun Hanji's manor,

191
00:11:18,799 --> 00:11:19,799
their fates unknown.

192
00:11:20,519 --> 00:11:21,799
Peony has gone missing, too.

193
00:11:28,759 --> 00:11:31,000
Do you know Jin Xiaohua?

194
00:11:31,279 --> 00:11:32,919
Peony's real name is Jin Xiaohua.

195
00:11:36,399 --> 00:11:38,200
She's recovering at the Sanshan Gang now.

196
00:11:38,360 --> 00:11:39,159
Don't worry.

197
00:11:42,399 --> 00:11:43,559
Why does each of you

198
00:11:43,559 --> 00:11:45,039
have a Club Jasmine commemorative badge?

199
00:11:49,159 --> 00:11:51,279
During Club Jasmine's second anniversary,

200
00:11:52,240 --> 00:11:55,039
we snuck out of Minchun Pavilion pretending to buy clothes.

201
00:11:55,879 --> 00:11:57,519
Welcome, everyone! Thank you for coming!

202
00:11:57,799 --> 00:12:03,480
Great! Wonderful!

203
00:12:07,039 --> 00:12:08,279
Give me one! Give me one!

204
00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:10,759
Here, there's one for everyone. Thank you!

205
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:12,919
Don't push! One at a time!

206
00:12:12,919 --> 00:12:14,080
Everyone gets one! Give me one!

207
00:12:14,080 --> 00:12:15,159
Give me one, please!

208
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:16,840
Thank you. Thank you.

209
00:12:17,000 --> 00:12:17,679
Here you go.

210
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:22,279
Seeing the badge reminds us of Chen Dieyi,

211
00:12:23,080 --> 00:12:25,879
and gives us hope that we can survive anything.

212
00:12:27,679 --> 00:12:28,279
Then...

213
00:12:29,799 --> 00:12:30,399
why...

214
00:12:31,159 --> 00:12:32,840
No need to dwell on what doesn't matter.

215
00:12:35,080 --> 00:12:36,039
Go on inside first.

216
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:37,519
We need to talk this over.

217
00:12:48,440 --> 00:12:49,759
The situation is clear now.

218
00:12:50,480 --> 00:12:51,559
The coastal defense map

219
00:12:51,879 --> 00:12:54,039
must never fall into Sun Hanji's hands.

220
00:12:54,759 --> 00:12:56,519
Otherwise, Rongcheng will be in grave peril.

221
00:12:58,240 --> 00:13:00,480
Before the garrison notices,

222
00:13:00,840 --> 00:13:02,879
the theft of the coastal defense map

223
00:13:03,200 --> 00:13:05,000
must be dealt with quietly.

224
00:13:05,440 --> 00:13:07,159
Once the Confidential Bureau finds out,

225
00:13:07,559 --> 00:13:10,120
they, and all of us who know,

226
00:13:10,120 --> 00:13:11,120
will all end up dead.

227
00:13:13,240 --> 00:13:14,159
In short,

228
00:13:15,200 --> 00:13:16,240
we must secure the map,

229
00:13:17,399 --> 00:13:19,720
and protect them too.
